++++++++++++++++++++++From 52170fc4c032dc67943c9cc4d8f8bb3df8ce341a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++++++++++++++++++++++From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
++++++++++++++++++++++Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:34:56 -0500
++++++++++++++++++++++Subject: [PATCH] rpc : keep one bad client from taking down the whole server
++++++++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++++++++With several clients sharing one rpc-server, any per-client failure that
++++++++++++++++++++++aborts or kills the process takes every other client's session with it.
++++++++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++++++++- send() now uses MSG_NOSIGNAL (SO_NOSIGPIPE on Apple). A client that
++++++++++++++++++++++  sent a request and FIN-closed before the reply killed the server with
++++++++++++++++++++++  SIGPIPE (exit 141); reproduced on loopback with a queued HELLO. send and
++++++++++++++++++++++  recv also retry on EINTR.
++++++++++++++++++++++- accept() distinguishes transient failures (ECONNABORTED, EINTR,
++++++++++++++++++++++  EMFILE/ENFILE/ENOBUFS/ENOMEM with a short back-off) from a broken
++++++++++++++++++++++  listening socket; only the latter ends the accept loop. A failed
++++++++++++++++++++++  TCP_NODELAY now closes the fd instead of leaking it.
++++++++++++++++++++++- Out-of-bounds tensor regions in deserialize_tensor and failed graph
++++++++++++++++++++++  computes log an error and close only that connection (its buffers are
++++++++++++++++++++++  freed by ~rpc_server) instead of GGML_ASSERT-aborting. A failed compute
++++++++++++++++++++++  no longer leaves a stale stored graph for graph_recompute.
++++++++++++++++++++++- Exceptions escaping a connection thread are caught and logged rather
++++++++++++++++++++++  than calling std::terminate.
++++++++++++++++++++++- Tensor cache files are written to a per-thread temp file and renamed
++++++++++++++++++++++  into place, so concurrent connections can't interleave writes to the
++++++++++++++++++++++  same -c cache entry.
++++++++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++++++++No protocol change.
++++++++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++++++++Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
