++++++++++++++++++++++ tools/rpc/CMakeLists.txt              |  10 +
++++++++++++++++++++++ 3 files changed, 487 insertions(+)
++++++++++++++++++++++ create mode 100644 tests/test-rpc-server-multiclient.cpp
++++++++++++++++++++++ create mode 100755 tests/test-rpc-server-multiclient.sh
++++++++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++++++++diff --git a/tests/test-rpc-server-multiclient.cpp b/tests/test-rpc-server-multiclient.cpp
++++++++++++++++++++++new file mode 100644
++++++++++++++++++++++index 000000000..e95efd3c9
