+++++++++++++++++Subject: [PATCH] rpc: take a client slot at HELLO, bound the handshake, report
+++++++++++++++++ a full server
+++++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++++- a connection takes a --max-clients slot once its HELLO arrives; health
+++++++++++++++++  probes and silent sockets never hold one, and the accept thread never
+++++++++++++++++  sleeps (a probe storm used to delay a real client by minutes)
