+++++++++++++++++  the oldest is closed to make room
+++++++++++++++++- a client refused at the cap gets an all-zero version in the HELLO reply
+++++++++++++++++  and reports that the server is full instead of a crash
+++++++++++++++++- a quick reconnect at the cap waits up to 500 ms for the previous
+++++++++++++++++  connection's slot, in the connection's own thread
+++++++++++++++++- test: silent sockets and a probe flood beside a real client; the test
+++++++++++++++++  script moves to another port when its pid-derived one is taken
