++++++++++++++++Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:15:06 -0500
++++++++++++++++Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: on integrated GPUs, cap the free memory of host heaps
++++++++++++++++ at MemAvailable
++++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++++The GTT budget only counts GPU allocations; memory that other processes hold
++++++++++++++++is not subtracted, so -fit and --split-balance could plan for more than the
++++++++++++++++host had (QA 2026-09-24: 24.2 GiB free reported with 18.8 GiB MemAvailable,
++++++++++++++++and a DeviceLost on an over-committed gabesrv06). Device-local heaps (a VRAM
++++++++++++++++carve-out) are not capped.
